  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Solid ice rapidly encases your body, protecting you from harm. You immediately gain 40 temporary hit points, and resistance against all damage except fire and psychic, and immunity to cold damage. Ice block continues until your concentration is broken, your temporary hit points vanish, or you end it prematurely.</p><p>While encased, you are under the effects of being incapacitated, with the exception of your concentration being broken.</p>",
